        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage J-SEV, Dexter Series Seville Door Lever Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic wave shape of the Schlage Dexter Seville Leverset is a simple way to add elegant style to your home. The universal latch fits either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\". Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This lever has a lifetime mechanical warranty and the 5 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Dexter Seville Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li>Universal latch fits either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2, 1996, Series 4000 Grade 3</li>\r\n<li>Exposed trim is made out of wrought brass or bronze. Levers are zinc-based and plated to match the finish you choose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>5-Pin tumbler standard Schlage C keyway (for Keyed Entry function) .</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n<li>5 year finish warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. A turn-button located in the middle of the lever locks the door while turning the inside lever unlocks it.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button. Inside locked and unlocked by turn-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: The Single Dummy Seville Lever is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Seville Door Leverset, Schlage J-SEV",
                "description": "Schlage J-SEV Dexter Seville - The classic wave shape of the Schlage Dexter Seville Leverset is a simple way to add elegant style to your home. The universal latch fits either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This lever has a lifetime mechanical warranty and the 5 year finish warranty.",
